        "original_id": "53d5bec9-37e5-5316-99fd-6ea48d1e0286",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Volkswagen CrossBlue, Honda Pilot, Volkswagen Cross Coupé GTE Concept, Toyota Highlander, Toyota 4Runner, Ford Explorer\n- Companies: Honda, Volkswagen\n- Systems: Volkswagen MQB platform\n- Places: American market, Canadian market, US market, Detroit, Los Angeles\n- Events: 2015 North American International Auto Show\n\nFacts:\n- The Honda Pilot is a mid-size crossover SUV manufactured by Honda and introduced in 2002.\n- The Volkswagen CrossBlue was presented in Detroit in January 2013.\n- In the American and Canadian markets, the Volkswagen CrossBlue targeted the Toyota Highlander, Toyota 4Runner, Ford Explorer, and Honda Pilot as competitors.\n- The 7-seat Volkswagen CrossBlue Coupé was shown in Los Angeles in November 2013.\n- The Volkswagen Cross Coupé GTE was shown at the 2015 North American International Auto Show.\n- The Volkswagen CrossBlue, Volkswagen CrossBlue Coupé, and Volkswagen Cross Coupé GTE together represented the versatility of Volkswagen's MQB platform and were aimed at the US market.",
